WEBVTT

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.351
how do we raise this beautiful boy
full of wonder and promise

00:02:00.375 --> 00:02:01.934
and so much power,

00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.958
in spite of our failures as a couple?

00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:07.375
The answer for me was simple.

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.393
I could either choose fear,

00:02:10.417 --> 00:02:11.976
fear of being alone,

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.101
fear of the unknown,

00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:15.684
or choose love.

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:17.768
And I chose love.

00:02:17.792 --> 00:02:21.601
That means seeing
the good in you as a father.

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:24.434
It means seeing
the good in you as a father

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:26.976
and not your missteps as a partner.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.684
It means putting Sekou first every time,

00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:31.833
even if it means I don't get my way.